## 📦 Workspace Structure

### Current Workspace Configuration
**File**: `pnpm-workspace.yaml`

```yaml
packages:
  - 'packages/*'          # Reusable libraries
  - 'services/*'      # Orchestrator service
  - 'tools/*'   # Dev tools (sqs-poller, dev-ack-simulator)
  - 'apps/*'             # Frontend applications (monitor dashboard)
```

### Package Organization
```
dtm/
├── packages/                    # Shared libraries
│   ├── database/                # @dtm/database
│   ├── order-processing-source-db/      # Workflow-specific source DB access
│   ├── kafka-producer/          # @dtm/kafka-producer
│   ├── kafka-consumer/          # @dtm/kafka-consumer
│   └── lambda-worker-utils/     # @dtm/worker-sdk
├── services/
│   └── orchestrator/            # @dtm/orchestrator
├── tools/
│   ├── dev-ack-simulator/       # DEV ONLY ACK simulator
│   └── sqs-poller/              # DEV ONLY SQS poller
├── workflows/                   # Workflow-specific configs
└── apps/
    └── monitor/                 # Preact+Vite terminal-themed dashboard
```

