## 🛠️ pnpm Commands & Filters

### Root Commands
**Location**: Root `package.json` scripts

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "build": "pnpm run build:packages && pnpm run build:orchestrator && pnpm run build:workers",
    "build:packages": "pnpm --filter \"./packages/*\" run build",
    "build:orchestrator": "pnpm --filter \"./services/orchestrator\" run build",
    "build:workers": "pnpm --filter \"./tools/*\" run build",
    
    "test": "pnpm --filter \"./packages/*\" run test && pnpm --filter \"./services/orchestrator\" run test",
    "lint:fix": "pnpm --filter \"./packages/*\" run lint:fix && pnpm --filter \"./services/orchestrator\" run lint:fix"
  }
}
```

### Filter Patterns
```bash
# Filter by path (relative to root)
pnpm --filter "./packages/*" run build           # All packages
pnpm --filter "./packages/database" run build    # Specific package

# Filter by package name
pnpm --filter @dtm/database run build
pnpm --filter @dtm/* run build     # All with namespace

# Multiple filters
pnpm --filter "./packages/*" --filter "./services/*" run test

# Parallel execution (default)
pnpm -r run build  # Runs in all workspaces in parallel

# Sequential execution
pnpm -r --workspace-concurrency=1 run build
```

### Common Commands
```bash
# Install all dependencies (from root)
pnpm install

# Install in specific workspace
pnpm --filter @dtm/database add typeorm

# Install dev dependency
pnpm --filter @dtm/orchestrator add -D @types/node

# Install workspace dependency
pnpm --filter @dtm/orchestrator add @dtm/database@workspace:*

# Update dependencies
pnpm update

# Rebuild all
pnpm run build

# Clean node_modules
rm -rf node_modules packages/*/node_modules services/*/node_modules
pnpm install
```

