## 🔧 Package.json Best Practices

### Package Naming
```json
{
  "name": "@dtm/database",  // ✅ Scoped namespace
  "version": "1.0.0",                     // ✅ Semantic versioning
  "private": true,                        // ✅ Not published to npm
  "main": "dist/index.js",                // ✅ Built output
  "types": "dist/index.d.ts",             // ✅ TypeScript definitions
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc",                       // ✅ Build command
    "test": "jest",                       // ✅ Test command
    "lint": "eslint \"src/**/*.ts\""      // ✅ Lint command
  }
}
```

### Dependencies Organization
```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    // ✅ Workspace packages
    "@dtm/database": "workspace:*",
    
    // ✅ External packages
