## 📊 Performance Tips

### Faster Installs
```bash
# Use frozen lockfile (CI/prod)
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile

# Skip prepare scripts
pnpm install --ignore-scripts

# Prefer offline
pnpm install --prefer-offline
```

### Faster Builds
```bash
# Parallel builds (default)
pnpm -r run build

# Filter to changed packages only (in CI)
pnpm --filter "...[origin/main]" run build
```

### Cache Management
```bash
# Clean pnpm cache
pnpm store prune

# Verify store integrity
pnpm store status
```

